{"route":"/mandates/indian-pharmacopoeia/monographs-inclusion-exclusion-criteria","kind":"article","crumbs":[{"label":"Products & Services"},{"label":"Indian Pharmacopoeia (IP)","href":"/mandates/indian-pharmacopoeia"},{"label":"Monographs Inclusion-Exclusion Criteria"}],"updated":"2022-07-19","hiUrl":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/hi/%E0%A4%9C%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%A6%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%B6/%E0%A4%AD%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%A4%E0%A5%80%E0%A4%AF-%E0%A4%AB%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%B0%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%95%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%AA%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%AF%E0%A4%BE-%E0%A4%86%E0%A4%88%E0%A4%AA%E0%A5%80/%E0%A4%AE%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%A8%E0%A5%8B%E0%A4%97%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%AB-%E0%A4%B8%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%B5%E0%A5%87%E0%A4%B6-%E0%A4%AC%E0%A4%B9%E0%A4%BF%E0%A4%B7%E0%A5%8D%E0%A4%95%E0%A4%B0%E0%A4%A3-%E0%A4%AE%E0%A4%BE%E0%A4%A8%E0%A4%A6%E0%A4%82%E0%A4%A1.html","official":"https://www.ipc.gov.in/mandates/indian-pharmacopoeia/monographs-inclusion-exclusion-criteria.html","title":"Monographs Inclusion-Exclusion Criteria","bodyHtml":"<ol>\n<li><strong>Inclusion Criteria <br></strong></li>\n</ol>\n<p><span>  Drugs used in National Health Programs of India. (<a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/National%20Health%20Programs5302935603-4684016670%201.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" title=\"See Annexure I,\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">See Annexure I<span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>).</span></p>\n<p>  Drugs listed in Essential Medicines List.</p>\n<p>  Drugs approved by CDSCO (Generics not less than 3)</p>\n<p>  Fixed Dose Combinations approved by CDSCO and recommended by the IPC Experts.</p>\n<p>  Drugs considered appropriate by the Indian Pharmacopoeia Commission.</p>\n<p><br><strong>Exclusion Criteria</strong><br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>  Drugs banned in India.</li>\n<li>  Obsolete Drugs.</li>\n<li>  Drugs considered inappropriate by Indian Pharmacopoeia Commission.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Monograph_submission_checklist_Ver_2_final.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>IP Monograph Submission Checklist</strong><span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a><a href=\"https://www.ipc.gov.in/images/Monograph_submission_checklist_Ver_2_final.pdf\" data-file=\"pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"file-badge\">PDF</span><span class=\"sr-only\"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></p>"}